  "witness": "Unicode 15.0.0 full upper mapping after stripPrefix, prefix removed exactly once",
  "derivation": "aid label = case(upper, stripPrefix(text, '[Aid] ')): U+00DF -> SS, U+0130 stays U+0130, U+0264 has no uppercase in 15.0.0 (stays), U+FB06 -> ST, U+03C2 -> U+03A3; '[Aid] [Aid] x' loses one prefix only; '[Aid]x' is recognized ([Aid] prefix) but does not match '[Aid] ', so the whole text is cased; a line feed splits label lines. Contract vectors: contracts/unicode-case/15.0.0/vectors.json.",
